+# Synthetic cashflow UI harness
+
+This harness renders the selected application's actual `cashflow/page.tsx`, filters,
+accordion, chart and month modal. CSS modules and the application's Tailwind/global
+stylesheet are bundled. The surrounding `AppLayout`, Firebase authentication,
+profile loading and `useCashflowData` are explicit synthetic adapters.
+
+The data adapter uses the same fixture snapshot for baseline and work. It runs the
+extracted original synchronous item calculation unless `deferCalculation` is true
+and there are at least 200 own plus team contracts. It then supplies `rawSnapshot`
+and `calculationDeferred` to the actual page/worker hook. The actual worker hook,
+client, computation and view logic are not mocked. The baseline build disables
+the worker flag; the work build enables it. Shadow reporting stays disabled.
+
+The browser clock is fixed to `2026-09-12T12:00:00.000Z`, while `performance.now()`
+and animation frames remain real. Use the same browser time zone for both builds.
+Only `example.test` identities are accepted. The page's statement fetch is answered
+in memory; every other fetch is rejected. The runner must also deny external
+requests and serve only the generated files on localhost.
+
+## Build API
+
+```js
+import { buildCashflowUi } from "./build.mjs";
+await buildCashflowUi({ appRoot, variant: "baseline", outdir });
